    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/0aad66f979afde57169b3773131dddcc.avif?t=1591244864\" /></div><br><br>In this VR horror game your goal is to find 6 hearts within an underground maze. This is a re-mastered version of the original DK1 game released in 2014.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO HELL</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/94bdb62bf56ff9350def441d226f54e8.poster.avif?t=1591244864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/94bdb62bf56ff9350def441d226f54e8.webm?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/94bdb62bf56ff9350def441d226f54e8.mp4?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/fa4e1704ad2af1a8f91ad218c02fc6c9.poster.avif?t=1591244864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/fa4e1704ad2af1a8f91ad218c02fc6c9.webm?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/fa4e1704ad2af1a8f91ad218c02fc6c9.mp4?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> Armed with only a torch, how quickly can you find the 6 hearts to escape the maze? And will you resist the urge to look back.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND THE HEARTS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/cad0d5eadb21cd3c73b42212912f5fd9.poster.avif?t=1591244864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/cad0d5eadb21cd3c73b42212912f5fd9.webm?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/cad0d5eadb21cd3c73b42212912f5fd9.mp4?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/6b7ec8bca289bc6c574602558548681b.poster.avif?t=1591244864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/6b7ec8bca289bc6c574602558548681b.webm?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1028410/extras/6b7ec8bca289bc6c574602558548681b.mp4?t=1591244864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The core additions in this re-mastered edition are the use of the touch controllers, new lurking enemies and a leaderboard to see how fast you can complete the maze.",
